---
description: Consent, suppression, and jurisdiction rules
alwaysApply: true
---
Maintain a purpose-based consent ledger and suppression records.
Before every marketing send: global suppression, client suppression, consent, topic preference, jurisdiction, then campaign eligibility.
AI must never bypass suppression, consent, or approval policy.
Do not hardcode one global privacy regime. Use client jurisdiction profiles.
Retention is per data class. Do not keep all data forever.
Legal, refund, dispute, material negotiation, and unapproved pricing replies stay human-reviewed.
